            <fr:route>/csolve/</fr:route>
            <fr:title text="CSolve: Verifying C with Liquid Types">CSolve: Verifying C with Liquid Types</fr:title>
            <fr:taxon>Reference</fr:taxon>
            <fr:meta name="venue">
              <fr:link href="/cav2012/" title="CAV 2012: Computer Aided Verification" uri="https://abakst.github.io/cav2012/" display-uri="cav2012" type="local"><html:em>CAV 2012</html:em>: Computer Aided Verification</fr:link>
            </fr:meta>
            <fr:meta name="doi">10.1007/978-3-642-31424-7_59</fr:meta>
          </fr:frontmatter>
          <fr:mainmatter>
            <html:p>We present CSolve, an automated verifier for C programs based on Liquid Type inference. We show how CSolve verifies memory safety through an example and describe its architecture and interface.</html:p>
          </fr:mainmatter>
        </fr:tree>
        <fr:tree show-metadata="true" expanded="false" toc="false" numbered="false">
          <fr:frontmatter>
            <fr:authors>
              <fr:author>
                <fr:link href="/mingkawaguchi/" title="Ming Kawaguchi" uri="https://abakst.github.io/mingkawaguchi/" display-uri="mingkawaguchi" type="local">Ming Kawaguchi</fr:link>
